  "description": "Production-ready NVIDIA CUDA GPU backend for DotCompute. Provides GPU acceleration (21-92x speedup) through CUDA with NVRTC compilation, P2P transfers, Ring Kernels with NCCL support, and unified memory. Requires CUDA 12.0+ and Compute Capability 5.0+ NVIDIA GPU. Benchmarked on RTX 2000 Ada (CC 8.9).",
